{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"soft body cloth collision soft body cloth collision","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","fileName":"Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Soft-Body Cloth Collision","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-15 18:17\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Particle and Destruction VFX]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"soft body cloth collision soft body cloth collision","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","fileName":"Soft-Body Cloth Collision.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Soft-Body Cloth Collision","heading":"Soft-Body Cloth Collision","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A pliable object should deform as forces act on it rather than behave like an unyielding fragment. The book demonstrates this by holding the top edge of a textured plane and animating a sphere into and away from it as a collider. The cloth simulation supplies the resulting bend and rebound without hand-keyframing every fold. Soft-body dynamics suit flags, fabric, and other compliant forms; complex liquid or gas interaction calls for [[Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Particle and Destruction VFX","Fluid Simulation of Splashes and Fire","digitalvisualeffectsandcompositing.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Soft-Body